OL,3,AChronic UTIs made MP 'feel like a drug
OL,4,Auser'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This story contains reference
OL,7,Fto suicide
OL,9,FAn MP says she was left "feeling like a
OL,10,Fdrug user" while trying desperately to
OL,11,Ffind pain relief for chronic urinary
OL,12,Ftract infections (UTIs).
OL,14,FLabour MP Dr Allison Gardner has been
OL,15,Fliving with the "searing pain" of
OL,16,Frecurrent infections for about 10
OL,17,Fyears, after first experiencing
OL,18,Fsymptoms with perimenopause.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
