OL,3,AChronic UTIs made MP 'feel like a drug
OL,4,Auser'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to the Chronic Urinary Tract
OL,7,FCampaign (CUTIC), more than 1.6 million
OL,8,Fwomen in the UK suffer from chronic
OL,9,Flower urinary tract symptoms, but there
OL,10,Fis no official medical definition of
OL,11,Fthe condition.
